@NETUnpaused90_HostAddress = http://localhost:5165

### 1. Get All Matches
GET {{NETUnpaused90_HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Match Details (Arsenal vs Liverpool)
GET {{NETUnpaused90_HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/PL2027-001
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Match Timeline (Full Match)
GET {{NETUnpaused90_HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/PL2027-001/timeline
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Match Timeline up to Minute 60 (Simulating Dad joining at 60')
GET {{NETUnpaused90_HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/PL2027-001/timeline?upToMinute=60
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Match Insights / Key Moments
GET {{NETUnpaused90_HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/PL2027-001/insights
Accept: application/json

### 6. POST Catch Me Up (Hero Endpoint - Dad left at 30', joined back at 60', Liverpool Fan, Casual Mode)
POST {{NETUnpaused90_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catchup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matchId": "PL2027-001",
  "lastViewedMinute": 30,
  "currentMinute": 60,
  "viewMode": "casual",
  "favoriteTeam": "Liverpool",
  "language": "en"
}

### 7. POST Personalized Match Summary (Analyst Mode)
POST {{NETUnpaused90_HostAddress}}/api/v1/personalized-summary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matchId": "PL2027-001",
  "mode": "analyst",
  "favoriteTeam": "Arsenal",
  "length": "1m",
  "language": "en"
}

### 8. POST Explain Event ("Why It Matters" for EV005 - Salah's 54' Equalizer)
POST {{NETUnpaused90_HostAddress}}/api/v1/explain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matchId": "PL2027-001",
  "eventId": "EV005",
  "viewMode": "casual",
  "language": "en"
}
